lateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcZzqDqtWoI/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by WTA (@wta)</a></p></div></blockquote>\r\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><p>In a 1-hour and 14-minute final, the trend continued as Gauff never trailed. She opened up a 5-0 lead in less than a half hour on court, and things only got complicated when she was already ahead 6-2, 5-2. She failed to serve out the match in the eighth game of the second set, but broke Pegula at love to finish the match. </p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n<div class=\"livelike-embed widget theme-purple has-bg page-grid\">\n        <header class=\"widget-header  widget-header__no-link-to\">\n                    <h2 class=\"widget-header__title h-m-sb\">How far will Gauff go at the US Open?</h2>\n\n\n        </header>\n    <section\n        class=\"livelike-embed__content\"\n        data-widget=\"livelike/render-livelike-embed\"\n        data-widget-id=\"8c9922bf-89c2-44e5-99d1-6ff667ae7e98\"\n        data-widget-type=\"Text Poll\"\n    ></section>\n</div>\n</div><p>In her runner-up speech, Pegula called Gauff \"like a backboard today.\"</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n</div><p>\"It was not fun to play against,\" she said jokingly. \"I didn’t even think I played bad.\"</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n</div><p>Gauff's final line agreed with Pegula's assessment. She won 65% of points on the first serve (to Pegula's 47%) and converted five of six break points. She was a constant presence in Pegula's service games -- winning 32 points -- as she herself was only taken to deuce once.</p>\n<p>\"I think it was a long journey, but I'm happy,\" Gauff said. \"I think it's night and day, the player I was last year to now. I don't think that this is an indicator that I'm going to do well in New York. Just knowing the quality ones that I had this week, hopefully I can use that experience.\"</p>",
